  "details": "1. Open VRChat. VR or Desktop is irrelevant.\n\n2. Visit the following world https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_c99740c1-0823-420d-91ce-3e8beaae741c/info\n\n3. Open the big menu and navigate to Settings -> Graphics -> Advanced -> Forced Camera Near Distance (at the very bottom)\n\n4. Set that to \"Forced\"\n\nChanging that setting to Forced will make the world go completely white, not a big deal since the Forced setting is known to mess with worlds. However in this case the menus are also affected, several parts will get covered by the white and disappear. They are still functional if you remember where they are, but hard to find and use",
